# Our entry in the front Caddy of the server (ADR 0011). The deploy job puts this
# file into the shared Docker volume `caddy-sites` as uhrturm.caddy (deploy/install-site.sh);
# the front Caddy (household app, label edge.caddy=true) imports every *.caddy file in it
# and is reloaded without a restart. A domain change for the game needs only this repo.
#
# The front Caddy terminates HTTPS and forwards through the shared network `edge` to our
# container `web` (alias uhrturm-web, deploy/docker-compose.yml, deploy/Caddyfile).
# Each host name may appear only once on the whole server, or the front Caddy refuses
# the new configuration.
uhrturm-62-83-23-90.sslip.io {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy uhrturm-web:80
}
